  "description": "A .NET library containing restricted process executor which can be used to run Windows programs with restricted rights. RestrictedProcess.NET can also limit the time and the memory of a running process.",
  "id": "RestrictedProcess.NET",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-08-25T15:17:28.01Z",
